// @status: NEIGHBOUR
// @invariant: control_without_label
// @dimension: valid neighbour — buttons HTML names: an image button by its `alt`, a reset button by its own label
//
// The form found on 2026-11-06. Until ADR-0405, PW5014 refused
// both buttons for having no `<label>`.
module generality.label_buttons

view FindForm() !{} {
    <form>
        <label>Find <input type="search" name="q" /></label>
        <input type="image" src="/search.png" alt="Search" />
        <input type="reset" />
    </form>
}
